title: "Supermicro Observability"
abstract: >-
  A loopback-only Prometheus and Grafana host-monitoring stack with optional
  persistent high-frequency NVIDIA GPU sampling, explicit-device SMART metrics,
  cached fan-controller metrics, and fail-closed private host profiles.
